DESCRIPTION:Original event page(s):\nhttps://home.dartmouth.edu/events/eve
 nt?event=82939\nhttps://givebutter.com/hanover-klezmer-concert-for-ukraine
 s-children-of-war?s=fryrJg\nhttps://dartmouthgroups.dartmouth.edu/rsvp_boo
 t?id=1631341\n\nDescription:\nMusic for Good: Kommuna Lux Live from Hanove
 r- FREE CONCERT\nJoin us for this unique multicultural event beginning at 
 4:00 PM on Friday\, October 9\, 2026 at Christ Church at Dartmouth College
 - 40 College Street\, Hanover\, NH.\nWe are excited to join internationall
 y acclaimed Ukrainian ensemble\nKommuna Lux\nfor an unforgettable evening 
 of music while helping children whose lives have been devastated by war. L
 ight food will be available following this free concert. Our co-hosts for 
 the evening are Hanover Rotary Club\, the Lebanon Rotary Club\, and Dartmo
 uth Ukrainian Student Alliance.\nAll proceeds benefit the\nCommon Man for 
 Ukraine\n\, a humanitarian\, volunteer-led grassroots initiative of the Pl
 ymouth\, NH Rotary Foundation. Your tax-deductible contribution provide fo
 od\, generators\, emergency relief\, and trauma counseling for orphaned ch
 ildren and their widowed mothers. This is an immediate and impactful way t
 o help alleviate their suffering. If you cannot attend\, please consider m
 aking a donation. Non-anonymous donors will be recognized in the printed c
 oncert program.\nFREE event -\ndonations and sponsorships welcome\n100% of
  proceeds going to trauma retreats for the children and widows of Ukraine'
 s lost soldiers as well as humanitarian aid to frontline communities.\nThe
 re will be a short presentation about Common Man for Ukraine programs (app
 rox. 15 min.)\nFeel free to come up and talk to us after the concert to le
 arn more!\n4:00 PM - 7 PM (Doors open at 3:30 PM).\nThanks to our generous
  sponsors!\nDartmouth Student Alliance for Ukraine\nLebanon Rotary\nHanove
 r Rotary\nPlymouth Rotary\nDartmouth College\nCome for extraordinary music
 . Leave knowing you helped bring hope\, healing\, and practical aid to Ukr
 aine's children and families.\nHere's the link for more information:\nhttp
 s://givebutter.com/hanover-klezmer-concert-for-ukraines-children-of-war?s=
 fryrJg\n\nSponsor / organizer: Dartmouth Student Alliance for Ukraine\n\nA
 udience: Public\n\nSource: Dartmouth\, Dartmouth Groups\n\nWhy this was in
 cluded: explicit food-service wording\; food keyword near service context 
 in summary\; Free Food category\n\nFood availability is inferred from the 
 source listing\; verify details before attending.
