DESCRIPTION:Original event page(s):\nhttps://dartmouthgroups.dartmouth.edu
 /rsvp_boot?id=1631852\n\nDescription:\nIn partnership with Queer History C
 elebration and the Native American Program\, this Healing Across the Diasp
 ora series\, Queer Indigeneity\, creates space to explore the experiences 
 and identities of people at the intersections of Latine\, Caribbean\, Indi
 genous\, and queer communities.\nThrough conversation and reflection\, par
 ticipants will consider the ways identity\, culture\, community\, and belo
 nging intersect across these experiences. The gathering welcomes community
  members who hold these identities as well as those who wish to listen\, l
 earn\, and engage in solidarity.\n\nSponsor / organizer: Office of Plurali
 sm and Leadership / Native American Program\n\nSource: Dartmouth Groups\n\
